From 72e1973910c3d12da6e8f4fb2ec522fec1663ba3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
by: triplecN
Subject: [PATCH 14/20] add fuzz targets for the PER code

per_ticket_roundtrip, per_commitment_roundtrip, per_parse_commitment and
per_next_state exercise the ticket serialization and id, the commitment
parser, the payout-script bound and the reservoir state transition with
arbitrary inputs. The fuzz binary links bitcoin_node so per.cpp is
available; the targets are not part of the default build
(BUILD_FUZZ_BINARY=OFF), so the shipped binaries are unchanged.
---
 src/test/fuzz/CMakeLists.txt |   1 +
 src/test/fuzz/per.cpp        | 126 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 127 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/test/fuzz/per.cpp

diff --git a/src/test/fuzz/CMakeLists.txt b/src/test/fuzz/CMakeLists.txt
index fc82fdc..fdf7c21 100644
--- a/src/test/fuzz/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/src/test/fuzz/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -86,6 +86,7 @@ add_executable(fuzz
   parse_script.cpp
   parse_univalue.cpp
   partially_downloaded_block.cpp
+  per.cpp
   policy_estimator.cpp
   policy_estimator_io.cpp
   poolresource.cpp
diff --git a/src/test/fuzz/per.cpp b/src/test/fuzz/per.cpp
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..52db705
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/test/fuzz/per.cpp
@@ -0,0 +1,126 @@
+// Copyright (c) 2026 triplecN
